    "idSpace": "Gen V met-location index (block D offset 0x80) — also the current-location id",
    "sources": [
      "Bulbapedia: List of locations by index number (Generation V) — EN names + full index",
      "Poképédia (pokepedia.fr) Catégorie:Lieu d'Unys and per-location pages — FR names, English equivalents cross-checked via each page's 'Nom anglais' infobox",
      "Pokébip 'Guide des Lieux' (Pokémon Noir 2 / Blanc 2) — FR cross-check"
    ],
    "verifiedAnchors": {
      "117": "Aspertia City / Pavonnay",
      "124": "Route 19"
    },
    "coverage": {
      "en": "ids 1-153 (full Unova/Gen5 overworld index: cities, towns, all routes, caves, gates, bridges, towers, landmarks) + Entralink duplicates 76-105 + key region/trade ids (30004-30007, 30015)",
      "fr": "all settlements + most routes/caves/bridges/landmarks confirmed against Poképédia. Omitted (EN fallback) where no authoritative FR name was found: 46 Royal Unova, 47 Gear Station, 55 Rumination Field, 73-75 Entralink chambers/forest, 76-105 Entralink duplicates, 106-115 city/route gates, 137 Clay Tunnel, 145-146 Virbank/Aspertia Gates, 150-152 Giant-Chasm chambers."
    },
    "notes": [
      "Routes are 'Route N' in both languages EXCEPT the FR water routes: id 30 (Route 17) = 'Chenal 17', id 126 (Route 21) = 'Chenal 21' (official FR in-game names per Poképédia).",
      "STARTER-FILE CORRECTION: the previous draft had 118 (Virbank City) FR = 'Méanville' — WRONG. 'Méanville' is Nimbasa City (id 9). Virbank City = 'Ondes-sur-Mer'.",
      "id 36 in B2W2 is the Pokémon World Tournament (it reuses the BW Cold Storage map id).",
      "ids 76-105 are the Entralink-internal copies of overworld maps; included in EN for index completeness.",
      "Consider extracting names from the ROM text (NARC a/0/0/2) for automatic in-ROM-language coverage — see docs/LOCATIONS.md."
    ]
  },
